t","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, these look like states. Now let me check if there are territories or other rows I should exclude. Let me check how many rows there are and look for any unusual names.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01DTpm5d9RD2Mgg2jeDKRqeL","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"farmers_markets","compose":"source.select('state_name')","limit":0}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":13,"output":167,"cacheRead":16991,"cacheWrite":619,"totalTokens":17790,"cost":{"input":0.000013,"output":0.000835,"cacheRead":0.0016991,"cacheWrite":0.00077375,"total":0.00332085},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":42},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786911582197,"responseId":"msg_011Ce73gbeqCWTMEkyeE4PW1","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01DTpm5d9RD2Mgg2jeDKRqeL","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"state_name\"\n\"California\"\n\"New York\"\n\"Pennsylvania\"\n\"Minnesota\"\n\"Illinois\"\n\"Virginia\"\n\"Wisconsin\"\n\"Michigan\"\n\"Massachusetts\"\n\"Florida\"\n\"Georgia\"\n\"Ohio\"\n\"Texas\"\n\"Missouri\"\n\"North Carolina\"\n\"Iowa\"\n\"Kentucky\"\n\"Indiana\"\n\"Colorado\"\n\"Washington\"\n\"Maryland\"\n\"Connecticut\"\n\"Kansas\"\n\"Oregon\"\n\"Alabama\"\n\"Oklahoma\"\n\"Arizona\"\n\"Tennessee\"\n\"South Carolina\"\n\"New Jersey\"\n\"Montana\"\n\"Arkansas\"\n\"Louisiana\"\n\"Vermont\"\n\"Alaska\"\n\"Idaho\"\n\"West Virginia\"\n\"Wyoming\"\n\"Nebraska\"\n\"District Of Columbia\"\n\"New Hampshire\"\n\"Mississippi\"\n\"Delaware\"\n\"Maine\"\n\"New Mexico\"\n\"Rhode Island\"\n\"Utah\"\n\"Nevada\"\n\"North Dakota\"\n\"South Dakota\"\n\"Hawaii\"\n\"Puerto Rico\"\n\"Virgin Islands\"\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786911585591},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the list now. The territories appear to be:\n- Puerto Rico\n- Virgin Islands\n\nPlus we have:\n- District Of Columbia (which is technically a territory/federal district, but it's often included in US stats)\n\nAccording to the question, I need to exclude territories. Let me check what the request specifies - \"total farmers markets (excl. territories)\". I should exclude Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands. The District of Columbia is not technically a territory in the US Census sense (it's a federal district), so I'll check if it should be included. For now, let me get the total excluding Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands.\n\nLet me also check the census data to see if there's a \"United States\" row.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01LCf4Hp4hyfnuMgwyhroS2Q","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"census_population","compose":"source.filter(source.NAME == 'United States').select('NAME', 'POPESTIMATE2025')"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":13,"output":288,"cacheRead":17610,"cacheWrite":417,"totalTokens":18328,"cost":{"input":0.000013,"output":0.00144,"cacheRead":0.0017610000000000002,"cacheWrite":0.00052125,"total":0.0037352500000000003},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":162},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786911585592,"responseId":"msg_011Ce73gt7HbhxMZaND4GdpZ","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01LCf4Hp4hyfnuMgwyhroS2Q","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"NAME\",\"POPESTIMATE2025\"\n\"United States\",341784857\n\n(showing up to 50 rows; pass limit or aggregate to count — do not page)"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786911590883},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! The 2025 US population is 341,784,857. Now I need to get the total farmers markets excluding territories (Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands). Let me calculate that.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create a metric that calculates farmers markets per 100,000 residents by joining the two datasets:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01N2HYzoezuAwTzni6ReDAhQ","name":"write","arguments":{"path":".xorq/scripts/build_fm_per_capita.py","content":"import urllib.request as u\n_o = u.build_opener()\n_o.addheaders = [(\"User-Agent\", \"Mozilla/5.0\")]\nu.install_opener(_o)\n\nfrom xorq.vendor.ibis.common.collections import FrozenDict\nimport xorq.api as xo\n\nso = FrozenDict({\"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0\"})\ncon = xo.pandas.connect()\n\n# Read farmers markets data\nfm = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv\",\n    con,\n    table_name=\"farmers_markets\",\n    storage_options=so\n)\n\n# Read census population data\ncensus = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv\",\n    con,\n    table_name=\"census_population\",\n    storage_options=so\n)\n\n# Filter US from census and exclude territories from farmers markets\nfm_excl_territories = fm.filter(\n    (fm.state_name != 'Puerto Rico') & (fm.state_name != 'Virgin Islands')\n)\n\n# Get US population\nus_pop = census.filter(census.NAME == 'United States').select('POPESTIMATE2025')\n\n# Aggregate farmers markets\nfm_total = fm_excl_territories.aggregate(total_fm=fm_excl_territories.farmers_markets.sum()).mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\n\n# Join on constant key\nus_pop_with_key = us_pop.mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\n\nexpr = (\n    fm_total.join(us_pop_with_key, fm_total.k == us_pop_with_key.k)\n    .mutate(fm_per_100k=fm_total.total_fm / us_pop_with_key.POPESTIMATE2025 * 100000)\n    .select('total_fm', 'POPESTIMATE2025', 'fm_per_100k')\n)\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":699,"cacheRead":18027,"cacheWrite":345,"totalTokens":19083,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.0034950000000000003,"cacheRead":0.0018027000000000002,"cacheWrite":0.00043125,"total":0.005740950000000001}